@startuml reward_decomposition_enhanced
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 9

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
  BorderThickness 2
}

package "Blue Agent Reward Function $R_t^{(b)}$" {
  component [**Deployment Reward**\n$\alpha_1 = 5.0$\n$\mathbb{I}[a_t^{(b)} = \mathrm{deploy}] \times S_t^{(\mathrm{deploy})}$\nSuccessful decoy placement] as DeployReward #E6F3FF

  component [**Deception Reward**\n$\alpha_2 = 15.0$\n$D_t^{(\mathrm{decoy})}$\nRed attacks decoy] as DeceptionReward #E6FFE6

  component [**Compromise Penalty**\n$\alpha_3 = -10.0$\n$D_t^{(\mathrm{success})}$\nRed compromises real host] as CompromisePenalty #FFE6E6

  component [**Removal Cost**\n$\alpha_4 = -2.0$\n$\mathbb{I}[a_t^{(b)} = \mathrm{remove}]$\nDecoy removal action] as RemovalCost #FFF2CC
}

component [**Total Reward**\n$R_t^{(b)} = \alpha_1 \mathbb{I}[\mathrm{deploy}] S^{(\mathrm{deploy})} + \alpha_2 D^{(\mathrm{decoy})}$\n$-\alpha_3 D^{(\mathrm{success})} - \alpha_4 \mathbb{I}[\mathrm{remove}]]$ as TotalReward #F0F0F0

DeployReward --> TotalReward
DeceptionReward --> TotalReward
CompromisePenalty --> TotalReward
RemovalCost --> TotalReward

note right of DeceptionReward : Highest reward $(\alpha_2 \gg \alpha_1)$\nEncourages strategic deception
note right of CompromisePenalty : Strong penalty\nDiscourages real compromises

@enduml
